9:["$","p","1",{"children":"Our vehicles are regularly serviced, clean and equipped with space for luggage, bicycles or ski equipment. Payment is possible with cash, card or Twint – with no hidden surcharges."}]
a:["$","section",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-nova-bg-soft to-black border border-white/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4","children":"Mobility around Arth-Goldau"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-4","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":"The location between Lake Zug and Lake Lauerz makes Arth-Goldau an ideal starting point for excursions. From here you reach the centre of Schwyz in ten minutes, Brunnen on Lake Lucerne in fifteen minutes and Zug in around twenty minutes."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"We are also available at night, when public transport thins out. Concerts at the KKL Lucerne, events in the Mythen region or rides home after a restaurant visit in Brunnen – Nova Taxi gets you home safely."}]]}]]}]
